scp-wall-metal-damaged-engineering-5 = Deep fissures and plastic deformations are present. The structure has lost its rated stiffness. Immediate repair with possible segment replacement is required.
scp-wall-metal-damaged-engineering-6 = Critical condition. Load-bearing elements are deformed to the limit. Immediate emergency work is required.
